{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing Innovative Gameplay: Big Bomb Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that mysterious Minesweeper on your old computer? It\u2019s back\u2026 and this time, it brought a BIG BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Minesweeper: Big Bomb, you\u2019ll still flip tiles and use numbers to deduce where the mines are hiding. But wait\u2014this time, it\u2019s not just about tiptoeing around danger. You\u2019ll also decide when to unleash the Big Bomb and blow everything sky high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play it safe? Or gamble it all in one fiery blast? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Bomb Mode <i>(IN A NEW WAY)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse Minesweeper \u2013 detonate everything!\u00a0Your goal is no longer to avoid the mines, but to boldly blow them all up! But beware\u2014hidden among the countless small mines is a single, devastating Big Bomb waiting to surprise you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traditional Minesweeper you grew up with, now with a twist. From beginner-friendly puzzles to hellish challenges across dozens of difficulty levels\u2014can you conquer them all? And don\u2019t get too comfortable, because the lurking Big Bomb adds a fresh layer of chaos to even the classics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits in extreme modes, chase your fastest times and highest combos, and keep smashing your personal bests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old gray tiles? Unlock a massive collection of custom skins for mines, flags, tiles, and backgrounds! Build your own one-of-a-kind battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl